          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Users need an at-a-glance view of line health and recurring problems, separable by ACX client.\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- Summary tiles show success rate over a selected period.\n- Failures are broken down by stage.\n- Failures are broken down by client, with a client filter available.\n- A repeat-offender list is shown for DDIs failing repeatedly.\n- A trend-over-time view is available."
            }
          ]
        }
